  "intro": {
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Robin Zeng Yuqun (born 1968) is a Chinese billionaire businessman. He is the founder and chairman of the battery manufacturer CATL (Contemporary Amperex Technology), and a vice chairman of the All-China Federation of Industry and Commerce.\nAs of 2026, Zeng is among wealthiest people in the world with an estimated networth of US$63.0 Billion according to Forbes and the Bloomberg Billionaires Index.\n\n",
    "sourceId": "wikipedia-en",
    "usage": "Research excerpt; paraphrase and cross-check before publication."
  },
